<title>JAPAN: Japan Steel Tower -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Steel Tower -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.51		vs	   13.48</p>
<p> Operating	  869    million	  vs	    1.14</p>
<p> Current	    687    million	  vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Net		  328    million	  vs	  549    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.42 yen	  vs	   24.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     23 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   --		 vs	     --</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Steel Tower Co Ltd is a manufacturer of steel pipe towers for power transmission.</p>
